YAML different course:
Its human readable data serilization language.Consider we have a server like above and developer is asking for configuration of that server, if we just send in text format like qtest-backed, 5001, false 1.0 etc they wont understand and if they want that data to be used as input to script they cant parse it, but if we write in yaml everything have key value pair so easy to read and parse the data.
Adv of ymal compared to json is in json everything written like {} and , for developer it easy to understand but for devops engineer it hard to interpert and we can add comments but in json cant do that.
Where yaml user: all devps tools like kubernites, docker, ansible, github actions 
